  "body": "Step inside and feel the difference. This beautifully designed home offers high-end specs, quality finishes and a light-filled layout that is made for modern family living.\r\n\r\nThe soaring entrance creates an impressive first impression, flowing through to the open-plan living, dining and kitchen area. The kitchen is finished with premium Miele appliances, perfect for those who enjoy both style and quality.\r\n\r\nWith four bedrooms, two bathrooms and generous living spaces, there is room for everyone. The sunny and private yard is a real highlight, a great spot for morning coffee, family time or summer entertaining.\r\n\r\nAdding even more value is the separate one-bedroom, one-living-area, one-bathroom setup, offering excellent potential for a granny flat, extended family, guests or additional income.\r\n\r\nKey features:\r\n\r\n• High-end specification throughout\r\n• Soaring entrance ceiling\r\n• Premium Miele kitchen appliances\r\n• Spacious open-plan living and dining\r\n• Four bedrooms and two bathrooms, including master ensuite\r\n• Sunny and private outdoor area\r\n• Flexible 1-bedroom, 1-living, 1-bathroom setup\r\n• Excellent granny flat potential\r\n• 10 Years Master Build Guarantee and Central air conditioning unit\r\n\r\nLocated in the popular Ara Hills community, this home is just minutes from Orewa town centre and beach, with easy access to SH1 for travel north or south.\r\n\r\nContact us today to arrange your private viewing or attend our open home.\r\n\r\nSee interactive features for this property on barfoot.co.nz. Click the \"View office website\" link at the bottom of this page.",
